Package: jarvis-classic
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-ui (= @VERSION@), jarvis-shell (= @VERSION@), jarvis-session (= @VERSION@), pcmanfm-qt, foot
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mmAbdelhay/jarvis
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ classic desktop
 A taskbar with Apps, Terminal, Files and Settings, a clock, the network
 status, and a Jarvis button that opens a docked chat. Used when the full
 @DISTRO_NAME@ shell cannot start, or when chosen on the login screen.
